ÿØÿÛ«schematic
  «text (-7000,3000) 2 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿SHUFFLER PCB (Version 0) - Qspice baseline: complete model with parasitics"Â»
  «text (-7000,2650) 1 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿Three Aiko modules, two two-phase converters (STD45N10F7 + ERUC23-4R1K + TMCS1126), 1ED3140 gate drive with bootstrap, copper / package / capacitor / cable parasitics."Â»
  «text (-7000,2500) 1 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿Open loop: 50 % duty, 200 kHz, 200 ns dead time, legs 180 deg apart. Every parasitic and setting is a .param in the PARAMETERS block at the bottom left - edit values there."Â»
  «text (-7000,2350) 1 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿Node names: PV1P / PV2P / PV3P / GND = string nodes (KiCad PV1+, PV2+, PV3+, GND). T1 / M1 / B1 = converter-1 rails behind the copper lumps, SWA1 / SWB1 = switch nodes,"Â»
  «text (-7000,2200) 1 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿gTA1 gBA1 gTB1 gBB1 = gates, BOOTA1 / BOOTB1 = bootstrap nodes, VREG1 = 12 V rail, PWM_AH1 .. = NUCLEO outputs. Same for converter 2 with suffix 2. Generated by PCB_Baseline/gen_shuffler.py --report."Â»
  «text (-6900,550) 1.2 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿REFERENCE STRING - same modules and load, never gets a converter (comparison only)"Â»
